cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Brassicaceae MAPK TE analysis scripts"
message: "If you use this software, please cite the associated paper and this repository."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Xu
    given-names: ""
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/USERNAME/Brassicaceae_MAPK"
abstract: >-
  Analysis scripts for TE annotation (EDTA), GFF3-to-BED conversion, and
  extraction of TEs overlapping gene regions (±2 kb) in Brassica genomes,
  accompanying the study "Evolutionary Dynamics and Subgroup-Biased Structural
  Divergence of the MAPK Gene Family in Brassicaceae".
keywords:
  - Brassicaceae
  - Brassica
  - MAPK
  - transposable elements
  - EDTA
  - genomics
